      "comment": "Vilemina: Vilemina's Defection",
      "content": "Vilemina grew disillusioned with the Frostmoon Scions and tried to join the Fatui. They refused at first. A female Harbinger (identified by the wiki as Sandrone) then gave her a chance, telling her to return to the Scions and follow the Traveler. She believed Lauma felt the same way as she did.",
