      "content": "Seeing the Traveler and the 'sibling' open the Scions' hidden chamber, she followed in secret and, in a moment of Lauma's hesitation, took the Moon Marrow. She decided that if someone was going to take it, it might as well be her, and carried it to the Experimental Design Bureau.",
