      "comment": "Vilemina: Severing the Antlers",
      "content": "Vilemina asked Lauma what happens to those who betray the Scions. Lauma recited the rite: antlers shorn with silver blades, then cast into the long night of unknowing. Vilemina cut off her own twin antlers on the spot, saying it was a last gesture of respect for the Scions' ways.",
